WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.535
Two more ways Club Steward takes work off your team's plate. Member service with a chatbot, and HR.

2
00:00:06.835 --> 00:00:17.202
Members and visitors ask questions right on your website. An AI assistant answers from your club's own answers, and after hours, every message becomes a case with a number.

3
00:00:18.502 --> 00:00:25.995
You decide what the assistant says. It works from answers your team approves, and it shows you every question it couldn't answer, so you can add it.

4
00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:34.352
When a person takes over, the chat is matched instantly to a member, a lead, or a visitor, and linked to their record in one click.

5
00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:44.206
Anything that needs follow-up becomes a case, with an owner and an answer-by time. Staff reply with saved answers, and leave private notes for each other.

6
00:00:46.106 --> 00:00:51.964
Every question lives on the member's record, right next to their account, so the next person knows the whole story.

7
00:00:53.264 --> 00:01:02.153
The service dashboard shows every team's response times and satisfaction, and each team sets its own hours and targets, so questions reach the right person.

8
00:01:03.514 --> 00:01:12.664
Hiring works the same way. Post a job once, and applicants arrive ranked by how well they fit the role, with every score explained, straight from their application.

9
00:01:13.964 --> 00:01:21.153
Names stay hidden while the AI reviews. It suggests the questions to ask in the interview, and a person makes every decision.

10
00:01:22.453 --> 00:01:29.903
You set the measures that matter for each department, and the fairness rules are built in. It never considers age, gender, race, or photos.

11
00:01:31.203 --> 00:01:34.880
Interviewers score each candidate from their phone, right after the interview.

12
00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:40.960
And candidates apply from your club's careers page, on their phone, in about five minutes.

13
00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:45.410
Member service and HR, part of Club Steward, by Ardn.
